{"id":"f2f2567f918b7690","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-graph-directed-graph.md","title":"ZFC Graph Directed Graph","display":"df-zfc-graph-directed-graph — ZFC Graph Directed Graph","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-graph-directed-graph","aliases":["58-df-zfc-graph-directed-graph"],"display":"df-zfc-graph-directed-graph — ZFC Graph Directed Graph","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch18/58-df-relation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-graph-directed-graph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-graph-directed-graph</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-graph-directed-graph — ZFC Graph Directed Graph"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7ccfc8c88f29968a\" href=\"?note=7ccfc8c88f29968a\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-relation.md\">../batch18/58-df-relation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,V,E \\in V\">\\(G,V,E \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGraphDirectedGraph}_S \\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGraphDirectedGraph}_S \\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}directed\\text{-}graph} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGraphDirectedGraph}_S(G,V,E)\\leftrightarrow G=\\langle V,E\\rangle\\land E\\subseteq V\\times V\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}directed\\text{-}graph} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGraphDirectedGraph}_S(G,V,E)\\leftrightarrow G=\\langle V,E\\rangle\\land E\\subseteq V\\times V\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Unlike the upstream simple undirected graph convention, a directed edge is an ordered pair and loops are permitted unless separately excluded.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"7ccfc8c88f29968a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-relation.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G,V,E \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGraphDirectedGraph}_S \\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}directed\\text{-}graph} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGraphDirectedGraph}_S(G,V,E)\\leftrightarrow G=\\langle V,E\\rangle\\land E\\subseteq V\\times V","display":true}],"bytes":779,"backlinks":[{"id":"d02164ac46da6fba","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D=\\langle V_D,E_D\\rangle$ and $\\mathrm{ZfcGraphDirectedGraph}_S(D,V_D,E_D)$ (see [[../batch09/58-df-zfc-graph-directed-graph.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2240","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-graph-directed-graph.md|58-df-zfc-graph-directed-graph]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","7ccfc8c88f29968a"]}